SUMMARY:The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash! (October 10th)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nGet ready t
 o turn back the clock and dance the night away to some of the greatest mus
 ic of the 80s and 90s!\n\nJoin us for a energy filled Saturday night at Th
 e Pheasant filled with great music\, dancing\, laughs and a fun crowd.\n\n
 \\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous 
 turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Plea
 se note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roug
 hly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back di
 ning area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartende
 r if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event
 )*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Detail
 s Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent D
 etails:\n**The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash!**\n\nDJ Ste
 ve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar favourites from two un
 forgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favourites with songs tha
 t bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun party atmosphere with di
 sco lights\, music and plenty of room to dance\n• Mix and mingle with ne
 w people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n• Come on your own o
 r bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Even
 t Fee: $5**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance 
 by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.
 com)**\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in the mess
 age so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nCome join us\, hit the da
 nce floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with music\, memories and good
  company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 8:
 30 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if you like)\n\n\\*Great 
 dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimu
 m upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lo
 ts of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.f
 irkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Law
 rence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
