SUMMARY:The Thanksgiving Turkey Dinner With Friends! (October 12th) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nCome celebrate
  Thanksgiving with friends over a wonderful turkey dinner in a warm and re
 laxed pub atmosphere!\nWhether you’re coming on your own or with someone
  you know\, this is a chance to share some laughs\, enjoy a great meal and
  spend Thanksgiving with a friendly group of people.\n\n\\*Please note tha
 t we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 bloc
 ks north of Lawrence and south of the 401). We are in the back dining area
 —come find us!\n\n\\*Please arrive between 6 pm and 7 pm if you can :)\n
 \n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely
 \,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n───────────
 ───\nEVENT DETAILS\n\nThe Thanksgiving Turkey Dinner with Friends!\n
 (Monday\, October 12th)\n\nWe’ll settle in for an easygoing evening of g
 ood food\, conversation and Thanksgiving cheer.\n• A delicious Thanksgiv
 ing turkey dinner\n• Drinks\, conversation and plenty of laughs\n• A f
 un gratitude icebreaker game to get everyone talking\n• Meet new people 
 and reconnect with familiar faces\n• Singles\, couples and newcomers are
  all welcome\n• A relaxed and friendly atmosphere\nCome hungry\, bring y
 our Thanksgiving spirit\, and let’s make it a memorable evening with fri
 ends!\n──────────────\nFRIENDLY REMINDERS\nEve
 nt fee: $5 per person for reserved seating and event organization.\nFood a
 nd drinks are purchased separately.\nPay the event fee in cash at the even
 t or by e-transfer in advance to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:stev
 eflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided\n\
 \*One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support the venue\n─
 ─────────────\nPARKING AND TRANSPORTATION\n\\*Lo
 ts of street parking on Avenue Road and free residential parking\nThe Phea
 sant: A Firkin Pub:\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/](ht
 tps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n\\*15–20 minute walk fr
 om Yonge & Lawrence subway station—or simply take the bus or an Uber fro
 m the station.
